### 변수
@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 매칭방 생성 - 정상 (서울시청 → 강남역)
POST {{host}}/api/matching/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hostId": 1,
  "departureLat": 37.5665,
  "departureLng": 126.9780,
  "destinationLat": 37.4979,
  "destinationLng": 127.0276,
  "departure": "서울시청",
  "destination": "강남역",
  "capacity": 3,
  "departureRadius": 500,
  "destinationRadius": 500
}

### 2. 정원 초과 - Capacity 검증 실패 (허용 0~3)
POST {{host}}/api/matching/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hostId": 1,
  "departureLat": 37.5665,
  "departureLng": 126.9780,
  "destinationLat": 37.4979,
  "destinationLng": 127.0276,
  "departure": "서울시청",
  "destination": "강남역",
  "capacity": 4,
  "departureRadius": 500,
  "destinationRadius": 500
}

### 3. 반경 초과 - Radius 검증 실패 (허용 100~500)
POST {{host}}/api/matching/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hostId": 1,
  "departureLat": 37.5665,
  "departureLng": 126.9780,
  "destinationLat": 37.4979,
  "destinationLng": 127.0276,
  "departure": "서울시청",
  "destination": "강남역",
  "capacity": 3,
  "departureRadius": 600,
  "destinationRadius": 500
}

### 4. 좌표 범위 이탈 - Location 검증 실패 (한국 밖: 도쿄)
POST {{host}}/api/matching/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hostId": 1,
  "departureLat": 35.6812,
  "departureLng": 139.7671,
  "destinationLat": 37.4979,
  "destinationLng": 127.0276,
  "departure": "도쿄역",
  "destination": "강남역",
  "capacity": 3,
  "departureRadius": 500,
  "destinationRadius": 500
}
